{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/steam\u5546\u5e97\u63cf\u8ff0\u6807\u5934.png?t=1743043179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Path of Redemption, Guided by Spirits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can summon elves to surround yourself and help fight against the surging dark creatures. Elves are divided into different races, and each race has unique skills that can bring different combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u7cbe\u7075\u5c55\u793a-\u591a\u8bed\u8a00.png?t=1743043179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random evolution and witness the legend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge randomly summoned spirits through chaotic synthesis to unlock unpredictable evolutions. Witness ordinary spirits transform into mythic <strong>Primordial Guardians</strong>\u2014each evolution redefines your battle strategy. Pair evolved spirits with exclusive artifacts to upgrade abilities and unleash screen-shattering combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u8fd0\u6c14.png?t=1743043179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>100+ Relics, Infinite Strategies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are more than hundreds of artifacts that bring endless changes to every battle. Artifacts can bring about improvements in attributes and changes in skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u79d8\u5b9d.png?t=1743043179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hidden Arcana, Limitless Potential!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_para